From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 06:58:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: release transfer capacity during local saves

Give storage a bounded independent slot. Stream marked SAF outputs with progress and retain the verified staging file until publication. Preserve WorkManager rescheduling after a system stop and export independent scheduler and network measurements.
